Package: rdevdash
Title: CRAN Package Developer Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Maciej", "Nasinski", , "nasinski.maciej@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
  CRAN Package Developer Dashboard, a comprehensive tool designed to streamline the process of tracking and managing CRAN packages.
  This dashboard is primarily powered by the `pacs` package, which is an essential toolkit for R developers looking to gain insights into package development, maintenance, and deployment on CRAN.
